    "description": "Precision System Science Co., Ltd., together with its subsidiaries, develops, manufactures, and sells automated systems and instruments, other physicochemical instruments, software, and other products in Japan, North America, Europe, and internationally. The company offers magLEAD 12gC LiNK, an automated nucleic acid extraction system. It also provides extraction reagents comprising MagDEA Dx SV, a prefilled reagent cartridge for magnetic bead-based nucleic acid extractions; MagDEA Dx MVII, a highly concentrated nucleic acid extraction reagent for viral nucleic acid extraction of cfNDA extraction; and MagDEA Dx SV RNA, a total RNA extraction reagent, as well as MagDEA Dx LV. In addition, the company offers fully automated PCR systems consisting of geneLEAD XII plus and geneLEAD VIII, which are fully automated sample-to-sample result instruments for molecular testing. Further, it provides research reagents, including LeeChip 45-uni, a lectin microarray for glycan profiling analysis; plastic consumables; and electronic equipment. The company's products are used for research and development, as well as for the in vitro diagnosis (IVD) testing market, including genetic and protein tests. Precision System Science Co., Ltd. was incorporated in 1985 and is headquartered in Matsudo, Japan."
